sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The CSMS supports retrieving / deleting CustomerInformation - CustomerCertificate
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a<br>Memory State: N/a<br>Reusable State: N/a

    CSMS->>CS: CustomerInformationRequest (report = true, clear = true, customerCertificate = <customer certificate hash data>)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: Message CustomerInformationRequest<br>- report true<br>- clear true<br>- customerCertificate contains <customer certificate hash data>
    CS-->>CSMS: CustomerInformationResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyCustomerInformationRequest
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyCustomerInformationResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
